      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Seems that all very old ones were removed, I actually don't have anything against that. Trolls you block probably don't play the game anymore, other people could change, and that leave us with that few people to block if they will be annoying again.\n\nBut at the same time this fixes one large issue for me and many other older players: Before hide avatar (and avatars stats) option was added a lot of people were blocked for random things, just being in same room as someone with weak PC could mean that you would get blocked so someone can regain few FPS... and they would just block anyone who is not their friends in public instance.\n\nSo if such old moderations (before current moderations tools were added) were removed, then I'm happy to hear this.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
