  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Wasn't a particularly good place for this, but I'm filing it under 'website' as it's API related.\n\nI was checking playermoderations and playermoderated endpoints as something seemed off, and sure enough, 98 of the 99 people I had blocked no longer have that moderation. Some of my moderations of other types are missing against other users as well.\n\nSimilarly, some of the moderations other users have taken against me are missing.\n\nI've checked with several other people and it doesn't seem to be isolated to only my account.",
